== Prize pool ==

The GCWC prize pool has grown significantly since the inaugural edition. The initial prize pool of approximately $500,000 in 2015 was funded primarily by [[Jocs Importants]] with sponsorship contributions. From 2017 onward, the tournament introduced community crowdfunding through in-game purchases, allowing players to contribute to the prize pool by purchasing cosmetic items, with a portion of each purchase allocated to the tournament fund. This model dramatically increased the prize pool over subsequent years.

