== Viewership ==

The GCWC has grown to become one of the most watched esports events in the world. Peak concurrent viewership has increased from approximately 1.2 million in the inaugural 2015 edition to over 5 million in 2021. The tournament is broadcast online in multiple languages and is available in all four competitive regions.

